      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### **What is a DataLoader?**\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "*   It is an object/method that allows you to iterate through your dataset easily\n",
        "\n",
        "*  It pairs up with your data set object (with the help of the __dunder__ function) in order to gain access to different images and their corresponding labels\n",
        "\n",
        "*  Examples of functionalities include shuffling data and dividing data into mini batches\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n"
